<title>EGYPT: Egypt cuts discount rate to 12.25 pct from 12.75.</title>
<headline>Egypt cuts discount rate to 12.25 pct from 12.75.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bank of Egypt cut the discount rate to 12.25 percent from 12.75 percent, the bank said in a statement published in newspapers on Thursday.</p>
<p>The new rate takes effect May 15, it said.</p>
</text>
